{"author":{"id":"baab9938d17c374ea6cceadec2cf8dfe966cceea1d7208ac14b0423eb5292995"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1779040015,"nonce":"Lydugo+zbvkOxI8VnrDeTo19uPw=","title":"license coments stripped by rolldown minifier in Vite 8","message":"**Package version:** `@urutau-ltd/vite-plugin-librejs` v1.0.0  \n**Vite:** `8.0.13`  \n**rolldown:** `1.0.1`\n**Node:** `v22.22.2`  \n\n## Description\n \nIn Vite 8 (rolldown backend), the `// @license` / `// @license-end` inline\ncomments injected by `renderChunk` are absent from the final `.js` files when\n`minify` is enabled (the default). The `weblabels` page and the\n`\u003ca rel=\"jslicense\"\u003e` injection in `index.html` work correctly.\n \n## Root cause\n \nThe plugin injects the comments in a `renderChunk` hook with `enforce: \"post\"`,\nrelying on the assumption that this hook runs *after* minification. That was true\nunder Rollup (Vite ≤ 6). Under rolldown (Vite 8), minification runs *after* all\n`renderChunk` hooks — including post-enforced ones — and strips the comments.\n \nThis can be verified by spying on both hooks:\n \n```ts\n// spy added before librejsPlugin() in plugins array\n{\n  name: \"spy\",\n  enforce: \"post\",\n  renderChunk(code, chunk) {\n    // ✅ code starts with \"// @license …\"  — plugin ran first\n    console.log(code.slice(0, 40));\n    return null;\n  },\n  generateBundle(_, bundle) {\n    for (const [name, chunk] of Object.entries(bundle)) {\n      if (chunk.type === \"chunk\")\n        // ❌ code starts with \"(function(){…\" — minifier ran after renderChunk\n        console.log(name, chunk.code.slice(0, 40));\n    }\n  },\n}\n```\n \nOutput:\n \n```\n[renderChunk]    \"// @license magnet:?xt=urn:btih:0b31…\"   ✅\n[generateBundle] \"(function(){let e=document.createEle…\"   ❌\n```\n \n## Reproduction\n \n```\nmkdir demo \u0026\u0026 cd demo\nnpm init -y\nnpm install -D vite@^8.0.0 rolldown@^1.0.0-rc.16\nnpx jsr add @urutau-ltd/vite-plugin-librejs\n```\n \n`index.html`:\n \n```html\n\u003c!DOCTYPE html\u003e\n\u003chtml\u003e\u003cbody\u003e\n  \u003cscript type=\"module\" src=\"/src/main.js\"\u003e\u003c/script\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\u003c/html\u003e\n```\n \n`src/main.js`:\n \n```js\ndocument.body.textContent = \"hello\";\n```\n \n`vite.config.js`:\n \n```js\nimport { defineConfig } from \"vite\";\nimport { librejsPlugin } from \"@urutau-ltd/vite-plugin-librejs\";\n \nexport default defineConfig({\n  plugins: [librejsPlugin({ license: \"AGPL-3.0-or-later\" })],\n});\n```\n \n```\nnpx vite build\nhead -1 dist/assets/*.js\n# Expected: // @license magnet:… AGPL-3.0-or-later\n# Actual:   (function(){…\n```\n \nSetting `build.minify: false` is a workaround — comments appear correctly.","files":null}]}